WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two clocks. Twelve minutes each. After one, you feel calmer.
Was it the soundtrack—or the pause?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In 1784, experimenters asked a version of that question
when they tested claims of animal magnetism.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
People reported experiences, but the proposed cause
did not survive their controlled tests.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Today, meditation research has promising findings and important limitations.
None of those studies automatically proves a particular audio product works.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying, compare a quiet twelve minutes with a free guided session.
Write what happened, not what you hoped it meant.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence. Choose the format that fits.
